    <briefdescription>
<para>Dynamics of the short-rate under the Cox-Ingersoll-Ross model </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The state variable <formula id="297">$ y_t $</formula> will here be the square-root of the short-rate. It satisfies the following stochastic equation <formula id="298">\[ dy_t=\left[ (\frac{k\theta }{2}+\frac{\sigma ^2}{8})\frac{1}{y_t}- \frac{k}{2}y_t \right] d_t+ \frac{\sigma }{2}dW_{t} \]</formula>. </para>    </detaileddescription>
